SUMMARY:✨ She Owns It AVL ✨
DESCRIPTION:✨She Owns It AVL✨\n**✨** **She Owns It AVL Meetup✨**\n
 \n**October Featured Guest:**\n**Palveshey**\, also known as **Naga Das\,*
 * is the **founder of Alternative Coaching Methods** and author of the new
 ly released *Dying to Live*.\n\nHer journey has taken her through AI resea
 rch\, finance\, academia\, and entrepreneurship to work centered on transf
 ormation\, purpose\, and consciousness.\n\nPalveshey will share her story
 —the unexpected turns that reshaped her life\, challenged what she belie
 ved about success and identity\, and ultimately led her to where she is to
 day.\n\nCome hear her story and join us for an evening of connection\, con
 versation\, and community💛\n\n**We can’t wait to see you! 💫**\n**D
 oors open at 5:30**\n\n**We’re so grateful for everyone who signs up to 
 join us! If your plans shift\, please update your RSVP—it helps us plan 
 and opens a space for another woman to attend.**
